{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q7K1AB7vCwAAb37RBco6h5","type":"tool_result","content":"1:# metadata-forensics — technique log (days 1-30; updated after every day)\n2:\n3:## Delivery layouts seen (resolve these before parsing)\n4:- Single / TT: one zip; members named in `artifact` after `->` (filename questions: artifact = the zip only). Mastery:\n5:  ONE download holding `-01.zip`..`-NN.zip` (D7 three levels deep); refs `<set zip> -> <member>`, names reused per set\n6:  -> resolve by (set zip, member). D9: download `<id>-mastery.zip` vs refs `...-evidence-0N.zip` -> resolve by sha256\n7:  (`lib.common.container_by_sha`). D6: two same-named downloads -> `delivery N: <zip>` refs.\n8:\n9:How this lane has looked so far (observations, not guarantees):\n10:- **Timed variants MUTATE** (organizer, D8: \"new, dynamic variations/mutations\"): solvers derive structure, degrade per field.\n11:  **D23 mutated the WHOLE carry-over kit** (values that sat constant D13-D22 re-rolled: PE/ELF arch, audio codec, video\n12:  dims, Mach-O became FAT, zip CD order shuffled) -- every carried extractor must parse the general case, not D-day's sample.\n13:- Every day = ONE evidence zip (plain Deflate, no password). D1-7: one tiny member, one fact; D8-9: cumulative kit in\n14:  every mode; D10-14: one field everywhere. **D15+ split the modes**: single = 1 field (the new member), TT = cumulative\n15:  kit (D15 20 -> D28 33 fields, +1/day), Mastery = N kits x the TT set (N=5 to D21, then +1/day: 11 D27, 12 D28), incl. a\n16:  cross-member \"synthesis\" question. Pre-arm EVERY earlier family AND the synthesis before the timed run.\n17:- Member families (one per day, each lasting ONE day as the single's field, then carried in the timed kit): note ->\n18:  jpg -> png -> pdf -> inner zip -> Go PE (D9-11) -> .NET (D12) -> MSI -> LNK -> OOXML -> `.eml` -> WAV -> MP4 -> ELF\n19:  (D19) -> Mach-O -> APK -> JAR -> SQLite (D23) -> EVTX -> regf hive -> Prefetch (D24-26 Windows DFIR: structure walk,\n20:  pointer follow, decompress-then-parse) -> PCAP (D27, network) -> raw GPT DISK image `disk-001.img` (D28: one layer\n21:  DOWN, the container of every earlier family) -> X.509 PEM `certificate-001.pem` (D29) -> a CORPUS zip\n22:  `cluster-001.zip` (D30: `relation.*` = relationships BETWEEN ~30 members, not one member's struct). Member name\n23:  `<family>-001.<ext>`.\n24:- fmt word = the DOMAIN, read it from the question: `email` (not eml), `media` (audio D17 AND video D18, ffprobe\n25:  vocabulary), `registry` (not regf), `disk` (raw image, not vhd), `relation` (D30, id family `cluster`), else the\n26:  plain format (`pe` `msi` `lnk` `elf` `macho` `apk` `jar` `sqlite` `evtx` `prefetch` `pcap` `x509`). Question `Determine <fmt>.<field> for <member>`; id\n27:  `dNN-<family>-NNN-<fmt>-<field>` (`.`/`_` -> `-`), `dNN` = the family's first day; `<family>` != `<fmt>` only for\n28:  media (`d17-audio-001-media-`) and relation (`d30-cluster-001-relation-`). Field = the spec struct's name.\n29:- Flavor text promises extra findings that are NEVER asked (D19-D28 every day: fleets, clones, nested launchers,\n30:  \"truncated, embedded, impossible claim\", \"selectively shortened timeline\", \"planted hive\", \"connect traces to hosts\",\n31:  \"reject malformed captures\", D28 \"locate evidence by offset, prove which image was rebuilt from an incomplete\n32:  source\"). Graded = the STRUCTURAL truth; names/extensions/secondary metadata are the lie. Titles pun on the field\n33:  (D19 \"Little Endian\" = EI_DATA; D20 \"Universal Appeal\" = fat; D22 \"Main Character Energy\" = Main-Class; D24 \"Event\n34:  Horizon\" = record count; D25 \"Hive Mind\" = root key; D26 \"Before You Go\" = Prefetch; D27 \"Packet Loss Prevention\" =\n35:  packet COUNT; D28 \"Where It All Began\" = partition START LBA; D29 \"Trust Issues\" = cert fingerprint; D30 \"Seeing\n36:  Double\" = identical-hash groups). Flavor depth shows up as TIMED mutations, not fi